[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12540.95, "timestamp": "03:29:00", "text": "就是这里，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12543.03, "timestamp": "03:29:03", "text": "你没有回答我的问题。当然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12545.269, "timestamp": "03:29:05", "text": "我没有。你来这里也是为了同样的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12547.67, "timestamp": "03:29:07", "text": "他之所以在那里，原因就在这里。强盗们也是出于同样的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12549.91, "timestamp": "03:29:09", "text": "不会放过我们。我们应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12551.83, "timestamp": "03:29:11", "text": "信任你。肯定有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12553.83, "timestamp": "03:29:13", "text": "我可以做些什么来说服你。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12557.19, "timestamp": "03:29:17", "text": "不用说服我。我不在乎。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12559.349, "timestamp": "03:29:19", "text": "向所有人表明你是来奉献的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12561.99, "timestamp": "03:29:21", "text": "不仅仅是拿走。我是埃斯基，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12563.99, "timestamp": "03:29:23", "text": "方式。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12567.429, "timestamp": "03:29:27", "text": "阿里。凯尔·克莱恩。 Eski，你能给我吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12569.349, "timestamp": "03:29:29", "text": "至少给点提示吧？你们怎么看？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12571.99, "timestamp": "03:29:31", "text": "需要？我想我或许能帮上忙。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12573.99, "timestamp": "03:29:33", "text": "记住，你必须归还"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12578.469, "timestamp": "03:29:38", "text": "总有一天会得到恩惠。一天。好的，明白了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12580.229, "timestamp": "03:29:40", "text": "地下水污染已有一段时间了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12582.63, "timestamp": "03:29:42", "text": "后退。想象一下如果你……会发生什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12584.469, "timestamp": "03:29:44", "text": "水又恢复供应了。我假设"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12587.349, "timestamp": "03:29:47", "text": "有办法做到这一点。是的，那里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12589.429, "timestamp": "03:29:49", "text": "是。做过很多管道工程"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12592.229, "timestamp": "03:29:52", "text": "这场战役中的游戏。所以，我知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12594.469, "timestamp": "03:29:54", "text": "去那里。我的天哪，太多了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12597.19, "timestamp": "03:29:57", "text": "修复水源的诸多任务。不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12598.63, "timestamp": "03:29:58", "text": "除非你遭遇死亡。我想是"}]